🔤 3. Strings in Python

Strings are used to store **text data**.

Example

```python
name = "Saakshi"
```

---

String Operations

Length of string

```python
print(len(name))
```

Convert to uppercase

```python
print(name.upper())
```

Convert to lowercase

```python
print(name.lower())
```

---

String Slicing

```python
text = "Python"

print(text[0:3])
```

Output

```
Pyt
```

